Useful Display Filters
rtp # show only RTP media packets
rtcp # show only RTP control/report packets
rtp.ssrc == 0x12345678 # a single media stream by its SSRC id
rtp.marker == 1 # talk-spurt / frame boundary markers
sip # the SIP signalling that set up the call

